From c7aed2fb892f600d90093836378864ef75adc905 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <assistant@example.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 02:46:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/22] Fix major revenue/tax/discount inflation bug in
 Report::summary() (Dashboard + Reports page)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause: summary() joined Sales -> SaleDetails -> Products in a
single query, then summed Sales-level columns (grand_total, tax_total,
discount_total) across that join. Any sale with more than one line
item got its totals counted once PER LINE ITEM - a single ₱100 sale
with 3 different products in the cart was reported as ₱300 of revenue.
transaction_count already correctly used COUNT(DISTINCT sale_id) to
avoid the same problem, but revenue/tax/discount did not, and neither
did average_sale, gross_profit, or gross_margin_pct, all of which
derive from revenue. This fed both the Dashboard's 'Today's sales'
card and every figure on the Reports page's summary cards and Daily
Revenue chart - any store selling more than one item per transaction
(i.e. almost all of them) was inflated.

Fixed by splitting into two independently-scoped queries: one at the
Sales grain (transaction_count, revenue, tax_total, discount_total -
none of which should ever be multiplied by line item count), and one
at the SaleDetails grain (units_sold, cost_total - which correctly do
need to sum across every line item). No other query in the codebase
has this pattern - checked every SUM(s.*)-style aggregate in Report,
Customer, Shift, and Reconciliation for the same join shape.

Verified with a real, executable reproduction (PHP + an in-memory
SQLite table matching Sales/SaleDetails/Products) using a single ₱100
sale with 3 line items: the old query reported revenue=300; the fixed
two-query version correctly reports revenue=100, units_sold=6.

Also fixed an outdated docblock on ReportController (still described
the page as role-restricted after the Roles & Permissions migration
switched it to a granular permission check).
---
 app/controllers/ReportController.php |  4 +--
 app/models/Report.php                | 53 ++++++++++++++++++----------
 2 files changed, 37 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/controllers/ReportController.php b/app/controllers/ReportController.php
index c3d9d31..f61741e 100644
--- a/app/controllers/ReportController.php
+++ b/app/controllers/ReportController.php
@@ -3,8 +3,8 @@
  * app/controllers/ReportController.php
